  "about": [
    "I started as a runner in 2018. Around 200 productions later I run shoots for Nike, Apple, Chanel, adidas and Jaeger‑LeCoultre, with talent from Robert Pattinson and David Beckham to Erling Haaland and Tate McRae.",
    "Calm on set, precise on paper, and big on making sure the whole crew has a good day. I care about inclusive sets and greater representation in the creative industries, particularly for the British East and Southeast Asian (BESEA) community."
  ],
